    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/fb922dd621b45321bb8d50d2e2e16d46.poster.avif?t=1751343883\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/fb922dd621b45321bb8d50d2e2e16d46.webm?t=1751343883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/fb922dd621b45321bb8d50d2e2e16d46.mp4?t=1751343883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NIGHT WILL PREVAIL is a fast-paced, twin-stick shooter\u00a0with bullet hell elements, epic boss fights and different characters with special abilities/upgrades to choose from. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through creature-infested levels and survive the night if you can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your hero, gear up and prepare for an adrenaline-fueled fight against the relentless horrors lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/4b1d8166f19e2b9d232c2a9aa249fd60.poster.avif?t=1751343883\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/4b1d8166f19e2b9d232c2a9aa249fd60.webm?t=1751343883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/4b1d8166f19e2b9d232c2a9aa249fd60.mp4?t=1751343883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/fb922dd621b45321bb8d50d2e2e16d46.poster.avif?t=1751343883\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/fb922dd621b45321bb8d50d2e2e16d46.webm?t=1751343883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/fb922dd621b45321bb8d50d2e2e16d46.mp4?t=1751343883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NIGHT WILL PREVAIL is a fast-paced, twin-stick shooter\u00a0with bullet hell elements, epic boss fights and different characters with special abilities/upgrades to choose from. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through creature-infested levels and survive the night if you can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your hero, gear up and prepare for an adrenaline-fueled fight against the relentless horrors lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/4b1d8166f19e2b9d232c2a9aa249fd60.poster.avif?t=1751343883\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/4b1d8166f19e2b9d232c2a9aa249fd60.webm?t=1751343883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626280/extras/4b1d8166f19e2b9d232c2a9aa249fd60.mp4?t=1751343883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
